# ==============================================================================
# Test: 01_geometry / test_primitives.fbl
# Description: Validates creation of points, lines, arcs, surfaces, and bodies
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Define Points in Cartesian Space
pnt p1 0.0 0.0 0.0
pnt p2 10.0 0.0 0.0
pnt p3 10.0 10.0 0.0
pnt p4 0.0 10.0 0.0

# 2. Define Lines
line l1 p1 p2 5
line l2 p2 p3 5
line l3 p3 p4 5
line l4 p4 p1 5

# 3. Create Combined Line and Surface
lcmb c1 + l1 + l2
gsur s1 + BLEND + l1 + l2 + l3 + l4

# 4. Define Arc with Center Point
pnt pc 15.0 5.0 0.0
pnt p5 20.0 5.0 0.0
line larc p2 p5 pc 6

# 5. Create 3D Body by surface sweep
swep s1 s2 tra 0.0 0.0 10.0 5

# 6. Check entity counts
prnt se all

# Done
quit
